-- The old Books moves into SLATE Books (31 Oct 2026). Run AFTER m_books_status.sql.
-- What it brings over, from the old Books artifact as it stood on 31 Oct 2026:
--  * 133 ledgers with their opening balances, 373 vouchers, 21 fixed assets, and the approved October 2026 salary sheet.
--  * 144 vouchers that had no number get one (type / financial year / next number, e.g. PV/25-26/001). Numbers already
--    written on vouchers (including Tally numbers) stay as they are.
--  * The Books settings: voucher prefixes, start date, depreciation rates and ledgers, fee income ledger, tax withheld ledger,
--    the overhead cost centre and number style. The closing date stays empty, so everything can still be corrected.
--  * The 14 projects that were only in the old Books become SLATE OS projects (no POD, no tasks), with their status and fee:
--    five Desdemona interiors running (Tk 3,00,000 each), Edison Hermia B7 and Edison Verona Site Office completed, Edison Orleans,
--    Celia, Camillo, Luxe Vista and Elena completed with construction support going on, Handyman Jolshiri running and
--    Titania A-5 completed (both with the fee to be agreed).
--  * "Fee to be agreed" fee records for POHS 13.9, Eskaton, Narayanganj, Comilla Companyganj and UC Haider, so money
--    received can be recorded against them.
--  * Nishat Nailah as a leaver (joined 3 Sep 2026, left 31 Oct 2026), so the October salary sheet is complete.
--  * Formal client names and notes on the Books projects; ACE OPAL's joint venture share (40%, with Volumezero).
-- Run once in the Supabase SQL editor. It runs as one transaction: if any step fails, nothing changes.
-- It stops without changing anything if SLATE Books already has vouchers.

begin;

do $$ begin
  if exists (select 1 from public.books_docs where coll = 'vouchers') then
    raise exception 'SLATE Books already has vouchers, so the old books have been brought over before. Nothing was changed.';
  end if;
  if not exists (select 1 from pg_proc where proname = 'books_os_status') then
    raise exception 'Run m_books_status.sql first. Nothing was changed.';
  end if;
end $$;

